00:31:48,531 --> 00:31:56,938
[SPEAKER_01]: And that does imply the view that you can release the mental pressure by breaking out into speech.

309
00:31:57,418 --> 00:32:00,061
[SPEAKER_01]: Whereas, actually, there are two different domains.

