00:32:00,101 --> 00:32:03,083
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if someone recognizes that you cannot

311
00:32:04,002 --> 00:32:23,637
[SPEAKER_01]: Actually, relieve that restlessness, or that worry, or that doubt, or any kind of mental agitation, by just talking about it, that... Or your emotions, like you said, like having this... talking about your feelings with other people, that releases it and makes you feel better.

312
00:32:23,737 --> 00:32:28,681
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, because I think it would be good to briefly clear that up, because

313
00:32:29,421 --> 00:32:46,397
